[*][b]DigitalVixen[/b] for AudioXL, which does the actual work of playing a custom sound where the game asked for its own. The patch file on this page is a build of AudioXL with two additions, shared under AudioXL's MIT licence, and those additions have been offered upstream.
[*]WopsS and the RED4ext team, jac3km4 and the redscript team, psiberx for the tooling the scene runs on.
[/list]

